      "cooked": "<p>I am using a docker swarm deployment with traefik as my reverse proxy and load balancer with ports 80 &amp; 443 being exposed. There is an issue I am facing where the “Admissions” page (for the Eductaion Module) with url <code>https://my.custom.domain/admissions</code> have links with trailing slashes <code>/</code>, which when clicked on redirects to port 8080 and fails.</p>\n<p>What are the workarounds to fix this? All other links in ERPNext are without trailing slashes, so I would imagine a source code fix.</p>",
